<p>These terms cover the PointerPath add-in for BricsCAD and AutoCAD, and this website (<%= site %>). <% if (legal.name === 'PointerPath') { %>"We" and "us" mean the business that sells it, trading as PointerPath<% if (legal.abn) { %> (ABN <%= legal.abn %>)<% } %>.<% } else { %>PointerPath is sold by <%= legal.name %><% if (legal.abn) { %> (ABN <%= legal.abn %>)<% } %>, called "we" and "us" below.<% } %> By creating an account, buying a licence or using PointerPath, you agree to them.</p>

