<% if (region.restricted) { %><li>PointerPath is offered in <%= region.where %> only. By creating an account you confirm that you are in <%= region.where %> and will use PointerPath only in <%= region.where %>. Buying, downloading and signing in are switched off elsewhere.</li><% } %>
</ul>

<h2>3. Your licence</h2>
<p>While your licence is active, you may install PointerPath and use it for your own work, including paid work for your clients. One licence covers <%= seats %>: PointerPath can be signed in on that many computers at a time, and you can sign a computer out from your account page to use its place on another.</p>
<p>You may not:</p>
